# ELECTRA TPS Management — Walkthrough

## Summary

Built the complete backend API for ELECTRA — a TPS Management System for PAN Kabupaten Sukoharjo. The system manages 2,402 polling stations across 12 districts with officers, assignments, vote results, and dashboard analytics.

## Files Created (48 files)

### Enums (4 files)
| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| [PollingStationStatus.php](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/app/Enums/PollingStationStatus.php) | `active`, `inactive`, `review` |
| [OfficerRole.php](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/app/Enums/OfficerRole.php) | `coordinator`, `kpps`, `witness`, `observer` |
| [OfficerStatus.php](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/app/Enums/OfficerStatus.php) | `active`, `inactive` |
| [ConfirmationStatus.php](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/app/Enums/ConfirmationStatus.php) | `confirmed`, `pending`, `absent` |

### Migrations (6 files)
- `districts` → `villages` → `polling_stations` → `officers` → `assignments` → `vote_results`
- All FKs use `constrained()` with appropriate cascade behavior
- Composite indexes on frequently filtered columns (`district_id + status`)
- Unique constraints where needed (station_number per village, one vote result per station)

### Models (6 files)
| Model | Key Features |
|-------|-------------|
| [District](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/app/Models/District.php) | `villages()`, `pollingStations()` |
| [Village](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/app/Models/Village.php) | `district()`, `pollingStations()` |
| [PollingStation](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/app/Models/PollingStation.php) | SoftDeletes, 3 scopes: `active()`, `byDistrict()`, `withoutOfficer()` |
| [Officer](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/app/Models/Officer.php) | Enum casts for role + status |
| [Assignment](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/app/Models/Assignment.php) | Enum casts, datetime casts for timestamps |
| [VoteResult](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/app/Models/VoteResult.php) | `submitter()` relationship to User |

### Services (3 files)
| Service | Responsibility |
|---------|---------------|
| [PollingStationService](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/app/Services/PollingStationService.php) | Filtered list, CRUD, map data, export query |
| [ImportService](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/app/Services/ImportService.php) | Delegates to PollingStationImport, returns summary |
| [DashboardService](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/app/Services/DashboardService.php) | Aggregate stats with efficient count queries |

### Controllers (7 files)
All use `ApiResponse` trait for consistent `{success, data, message, meta}` format.

### Form Requests (9 files)
Enum validation via `Rule::enum()`, unique constraints, proper `sometimes` modifier for updates.

### API Resources (7 files)
Condensed nested objects (district/village show only id+name), conditional counts via `whenCounted()`.

### Import/Export (2 files)
| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| [PollingStationImport](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/app/Imports/PollingStationImport.php) | Handles merged-cell carry-forward, skips JUMLAH rows, `firstOrCreate` |
| [PollingStationExport](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/app/Exports/PollingStationExport.php) | FromQuery for memory-efficient filtered export |

### Routes
[api.php](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/routes/api.php) — **29 routes** total, all under `auth:sanctum` middleware.

### Seeders & Factories
- [DistrictSeeder](file:///c:/Experience/projects/tps-management/tps-management-backend/database/seeders/DistrictSeeder.php) — All 12 Sukoharjo districts
- 6 factories with realistic data and state methods

## API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Action |
|--------|----------|--------|
| GET | `/api/dashboard` | Dashboard stats |
| GET | `/api/polling-stations` | Paginated + filtered list |
| POST | `/api/polling-stations` | Create station |
| GET | `/api/polling-stations/{id}` | Show with officers |
| PUT | `/api/polling-stations/{id}` | Update |
| DELETE | `/api/polling-stations/{id}` | Soft delete |
| POST | `/api/polling-stations/import` | XLS import |
| GET | `/api/polling-stations/map-data` | GeoJSON for Leaflet |
| GET | `/api/polling-stations/export` | Excel download |
| GET | `/api/districts` | All districts with counts |
| GET | `/api/districts/{id}` | District with villages |
| GET | `/api/villages` | Filter by district_id |
| GET | `/api/villages/{id}` | Village detail |
| CRUD | `/api/officers` | Full CRUD + filters |
| CRUD | `/api/assignments` | Full CRUD |
| PATCH | `/api/assignments/{id}/confirm` | Confirm assignment |
| GET/POST/PUT | `/api/vote-results` | Results + aggregation |

